   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Frazer</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>Hopefully others on the list will be able to offer some suggestions for you.  Given you are working with fairly small (&lt;30m) distances, you should see what you can learn about the accuracy of distance measurements at these small distances.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><u></u>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top\"></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<div>Eric Rexstad</div>\r\n<div>Senior Research Fellow, CREEM, Univ. of St Andrews, Charity SC013532</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9em;border-top:1px solid gray;min-width:250px;max-width:300px;margin-top:4px;padding-top:4px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/0?redirect=mai...%40st-andrews.ac.uk&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/0?redirect%3Dmailto%253Aeric.rexstad%2540st-andrews.ac.uk%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071077000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0e4QFYE18q_GRRqLRgo7HO\">eric.r...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"margin-right:8px\"><a href=\"tel:+44%20(0)1334%20461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a></span></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/1?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmaps.google.com%2F%3Fq%3DThe%2520Observatory%252C%2520Buchanan%2520Gardens%252C%2520St%2520Andrews%2520KY16%25209LZ&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/1?redirect%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmaps.google.com%252F%253Fq%253DThe%252520Observatory%25252C%252520Buchanan%2