    [
     1,
     "<div><blockquote>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Hi</div>\r\n<div>I&#39;m planning a distance sampling survey for a tropical forest bird species (Príncipe Thrush -\r\n<em>Turdus xanthorhynchus</em>) and am wondering what type of rangefinder to use . Distances likely to be in the region of 5-30 meters. Does anyone have a preferred rangefinder model? Would a basic golf/hunting model like this be suitable <a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/3?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.co.uk%2FTACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof%2Fdp%2FB07H3JS5L1%2Fref%3Dsr_1_5%3Fkeywords%3Drangefinder%26qid%3D1556790370%26s%3Dgateway%26sr%3D8-5&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" title=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/TACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof/dp/B07H3JS5L1/ref=sr_1_5?keywords=rangefinder&amp;qid=1556790370&amp;s=gateway&amp;sr=8-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/3?redirect%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.co.uk%252FTACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof%252Fdp%252FB07H3JS5L1%252Fref%253Dsr_1_5%253Fkeywords%253Drangefinder%2526qid%253D1556790370%2526s%253Dgateway%2526sr%253D8-5%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071077000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01xnZ1KaNeie5caejgKyNy\"><font color=\"red\"><b>MailScanner has detected a possible fraud attempt from &quot;link.getmailspring.com&quot; claiming to be</b></font> www.amazon.co.uk/TACKLIFE</a>?</div>\r\n<div>Cheers</div>\r\n<div>Frazer</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>--</div>\r\n<div>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;distance-sampling&quot; group.</div>\r\n<div>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href=\"https://link.