   "subject": "{Disarmed} RE: [distance-sampling] Rangefinder for distance sampling in tropical forest",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>There’s an interesting USDA review at<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://www.fs.fed.us/eng/pubs/html/98241307/98241307.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.fs.fed.us/eng/pubs/html/98241307/98241307.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-am7XnYzESzfJ22tQ-EwQ\">https://www.fs.fed.us/eng/pubs/html/98241307/98241307.html</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Two of the rangefinders they assess give high accuracy even at very small distances:  Impulse 200 and Laser Atlanta Advantage.  However, these are not cheap options.  The Bushnell Lytespeed 400 is\r\n less expensive, and works to reasonable accuracy at very short distances.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Steve</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">____________________________________________________________________________</span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">Stephen T. Buckland</span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">CREEM, The Observatory, Buchanan Gdns, St Andrews KY16 9LZ, Scotland</span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">Tel. <a href=\"tel:+44%201334%20461841\" value=\"+441334461841\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461841</a>        Secretary  <a href=\"tel:+44%201334%20461842\" value=\"+441334461842\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461842</a></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">e-mail    \r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">st...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a></span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:72.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">Professor of Statistics       \r\n<a href=\"http://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wJiYNII0o6JPglO-sFFQd\">http://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">NCSE                           <a href=\"http://www.ncse.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.ncse.org.uk/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XpMnQuX4RzF5PgJbG1ZY5\">http://www.ncse.org.uk/</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">CREEM                         \r\n<a href=\"http://creem2.st-andrews.ac.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://creem2.st-andrews.ac.uk/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yvCMrhNWRCX2K