     2,
     "<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Eric Rexstad<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 02 May 2019 11:25<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Frazer Sinclair &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">frazer_...@yahoo.co.uk</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> noreply-spamdigest via distance-sampling &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> {Disarmed} Re: [distance-sampling] Rangefinder for distance sampling in tropical forest<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Frazer<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hopefully others on the list will be able to offer some suggestions for you.  Given you are working with fairly small (&lt;30m) distances, you should see what you can learn about the accuracy of distance measurements at these small distances.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">Eric Rexstad<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\">Senior Research Fellow, CREEM, Univ. of St Andrews, Charity SC013532<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid gray 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm;margin-top:3.0pt;min-width:250px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:windowtext\"><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/0?redirect=mai...%40st-andrews.ac.uk&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/0?redirect%3Dmailto%253Aeric.rexstad%2540st-andrews.ac.uk%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JdFgQbCG7FOC_EbO3YyYL\">eric.r...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:windowtext\"><a href=\"tel:+44%20(0)1334%20461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:windowtext\"><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/1?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmaps.google.com%2F%3Fq%3DThe%2520Observatory%252C%2520Buchanan%2520Gardens%252C%2520St%2520Andrews%2520KY16%25209LZ&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/1?redirect%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmaps.google.com%252F%253Fq%253DThe%252520Observatory%25252C%252520Buchanan%252520Gardens%25252C%252520St%252520Andrews%252520KY16%2525209LZ%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1hpaIzvJVXQMBl6EcmrjKl\">The\r\n Observatory, Buchanan Gardens, St Andrews KY16 9LZ</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:windowtext\"><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/2?redirect=http%3A%2F%2Ferex.github.io&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/2?redirect%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Ferex.github.io%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24JAZ9mvW3BYCyD6qlEjE1\"><b><span style=\"color:red\">MailScanner\r\n has detected a possible fraud attempt from &quot;link.getmailspring.com&quot; claiming to be</span></b> http://erex.github.io</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On May 2 2019, at 10:48 am, &#39;Frazer Sinclair&#39; via distance-sampling &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><blockquote style=\"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt\"><div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I&#39;m planning a distance sampling survey for a tropical forest bird species (Príncipe Thrush -\r\n<em><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Turdus xanthorhynchus</span></em>) and am wondering what type of rangefinder to use . Distances likely to be in the region of 5-30 meters. Does anyone have a preferred rangefinder model? Would a basic golf/hunting\r\n model like this be suitable <a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/3?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.co.uk%2FTACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof%2Fdp%2FB07H3JS5L1%2Fref%3Dsr_1_5%3Fkeywords%3Drangefinder%26qid%3D1556790370%26s%3Dgateway%26sr%3D8-5&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" title=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/TACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof/dp/B07H3JS5L1/ref=sr_1_5?keywords=rangefinder&amp;qid=1556790370&amp;s=gateway&amp;sr=8-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/3?redirect%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.co.uk%252FTACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof%252Fdp%252FB07H3JS5L1%252Fref%253Dsr_1_5%253Fkeywords%253Drangefinder%2526qid%253D1556790370%2526s%253Dgateway%2526sr%253D8-5%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071079000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DXGtIQWZaqGewo6XjZ83k\"><b><span style=\"color:red\">MailScanner\r\n has detected a possible fraud attempt from &quot;link.getmailspring.com&quot; claiming to be</span></b> www.amazon.co.uk/TACKLIFE</a>?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Cheers<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Frazer<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">--<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;distance-sampling&quot; group.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div>"
