     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">Good morning,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">I am also interested in finding range finders for small distances. I will be more than happy if you can share your experience with us. Thank you all for your help!</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">Best regards,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">Irene</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br clear=\"all\"></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(0,255,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Irene Duch-Latorre</span><br>\r\n</span></span></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(0,255,0)\"></span>PhD Student, Department of Anthropology<br></span></font> <font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a href=\"https://strierlab.anthropology.wisc.edu/\" target=\"_bl