     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Frazer</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>Hopefully others on the list will be able to offer some suggestions for you.  Given you are working with fairly small (&lt;30m) distances, you should see what you can learn about the accuracy of distance measurements at these small distances.</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><u></u>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top\"></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<div>Eric Rexstad</div>\r\n<div>Senior Research Fellow, CREEM, Univ. of St Andrews, Charity SC013532</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9em;border-top:1px solid gray;min-width:250px;max-width:300px;margin-top:4px;padding-top:4px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/0?redirect=mai...%40st-andrews.ac.uk&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/0?redirect%3Dmailto%253Aeric.rexstad%2540st-andrews.ac.uk%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ngd0vS3tV3sh7S4AyFyxV\">eric.r...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"margin-right:8px\"><a href=\"tel:+44%20(0)1334%20461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a></span></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/1?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmaps.google.com%2F%3Fq%3DThe%2520Observatory%252C%2520Buchanan%2520Gardens%252C%2520St%2520Andrews%2520KY16%25209LZ&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/1?redirect%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmaps.google.com%252F%253Fq%253DThe%252520Observatory%25252C%252520Buchanan%252520Gardens%25252C%252520St%252520Andrews%252520KY16%2525209LZ%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2DM4FhDpnhVCMQjQ_ZB7X5\">The\r\n Observatory, Buchanan Gardens, St Andrews KY16 9LZ</a></div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/2?redirect=http%3A%2F%2Ferex.github.io&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/2?redirect%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Ferex.github.io%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3i6a-cIZVX8t9lJEpcpmOt\"><font color=\"red\"><b>MailScanner has detected a possible fraud attempt from &quot;link.getmailspring.com&quot; claiming to be</b></font> http://erex.github.io</a></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<u></u></div>\r\n<div>On May 2 2019, at 10:48 am, &#39;Frazer Sinclair&#39; via distance-sampling &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Hi</div>\r\n<div>I&#39;m planning a distance sampling survey for a tropical forest bird species (Príncipe Thrush -\r\n<em>Turdus xanthorhynchus</em>) and am wondering what type of rangefinder to use . Distances likely to be in the region of 5-30 meters. Does anyone have a preferred rangefinder model? Would a basic golf/hunting model like this be suitable <a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/3?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.co.uk%2FTACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof%2Fdp%2FB07H3JS5L1%2Fref%3Dsr_1_5%3Fkeywords%3Drangefinder%26qid%3D1556790370%26s%3Dgateway%26sr%3D8-5&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" title=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/TACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof/dp/B07H3JS5L1/ref=sr_1_5?keywords=rangefinder&amp;qid=1556790370&amp;s=gateway&amp;sr=8-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/3?redirect%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.co.uk%252FTACKLIFE-Continuous-Magnification-Measurement-Waterproof%252Fdp%252FB07H3JS5L1%252Fref%253Dsr_1_5%253Fkeywords%253Drangefinder%2526qid%253D1556790370%2526s%253Dgateway%2526sr%253D8-5%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792474071081000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1pECqqIDqTM96UVejlXPei\"><font color=\"red\"><b>MailScanner has detected a possible fraud attempt from &quot;link.getmailspring.com&quot; claiming to be</b></font> www.amazon.co.uk/TACKLIFE</a>?</div>\r\n<div>Cheers</div>\r\n<div>Frazer</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>--</div>\r\n<div>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;distance-sampling&quot; group.</div>\r\n<div>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href=\"https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/4?redirect=mailto%3Adistance-sampling%2Bunsubscribe%40googlegroups.com&amp;recipient=ZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%3D%3D\" title=\"mailto:distance-sampling+unsubscribe@googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.getmailspring.com/link/929...@getmailspring.com/4?redirect%3Dmailto%253Adistance-sampling%252Bunsubscribe%2540googlegroups.com%26recipient%3DZGlzdGFuY2Utc2FtcGxpbmdAZ29vZ2xlZ3JvdXBzLmNvbQ%253D%253D&amp;source=gmai